{"id":"e94ffc08db5cedf1","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-recursion-parameters.md","title":"带参数的递归定理","display":"thm-recursion-parameters — 带参数的递归定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-recursion-parameters","aliases":["43-thm-recursion-parameters"],"display":"thm-recursion-parameters — 带参数的递归定理","depends_on":["[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-thm-recursion]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Discussion following Theorem 5.3.1, print p.12 / PDF p.32","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-recursion-parameters"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-recursion-parameters</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-recursion-parameters — 带参数的递归定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eed0edda3cc36fc5\" href=\"?note=eed0edda3cc36fc5\" title=\"43-thm-recursion\">43-thm-recursion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Discussion following Theorem 5.3.1, print p.12 / PDF p.32"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>总可计算。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 与部分函数外延相等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists n:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(n)\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_{n(y)}\\simeq\\varphi_{f(n(y),y)})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Computable}(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists n:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(n)\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_{n(y)}\\simeq\\varphi_{f(n(y),y)})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按参数一致执行固定点构造；n是计算出的编号函数，不是待定义程序被先验假设存在。</p>\n<p>来源：Discussion following Theorem 5.3.1, print p.12 / PDF p.32。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"eed0edda3cc36fc5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e$ 与部分函数外延相等 $\\simeq$ 采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e$ 与部分函数外延相等 $\\simeq$ 采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computable}(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists n:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(n)\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_{n(y)}\\simeq\\varphi_{f(n(y),y)})).","display":true}],"bytes":1236,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-recursion-parameters]] — 带参数的递归定理"}],"outgoing":["4400f4836786a4bd","f357216a7edb035a","eed0edda3cc36fc5"]}